    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — LLM High-Cardinality Stress Tests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Three stress cases for the LLM pipeline under high-cardinality and concurrency conditions using in-process stubs and seed-42 determinism.</para>
<sect1 id="test__llm__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md33_1s1"><sect2 id="test__llm__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md33">
<title>Cases</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>HighCardinalityModelRouting : high-cardinality token distribution, 8-thread</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ConcurrentAdapterLifecycleStress : concurrent load/unload of many adapters</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>FallbackUnderLoadStress : fallback model selection under sustained load</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
